  message: "Fixed in PR #591 (selfh dev 3caccf12f1). _finalize_commit_dicts now sorts analysis_runs in place by (started_at, pass) — a deterministic, byte-stable ordering contract, documented in spec (AnalysisRun section). Two finalize tests cover the sort + None-started_at pass tiebreak; in-place sort preserves the behavior_map<->ctx identity other sub-steps rely on. Wave-4 contract-accuracy."  # 8657
